<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-BARBADOS 132-0 V INDIA (210) - LUNCH 2ND DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BARBADOS 132-0 V INDIA (210) - LUNCH 2ND DAY.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barbados, replying to India's 210, were 132 without loss in their first innings at lunch on the second day of their three-day match at the Kensington Oval on Sunday.</p>
</text>
